WEBVTT

00:03:58.526 --> 00:04:01.070
I just remember there being a lot of bugs.

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:04.115
There was no Wi-Fi at the headquarters,

00:04:04.156 --> 00:04:06.409
and the stores didn't have computers.

00:04:06.993 --> 00:04:08.828
And because there was a lack of trust,

00:04:08.869 --> 00:04:12.790
there were vendors in the lobby
demanding to be paid in cash upfront.

00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:14.625
And because of them,

00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:16.794
a lot of my employees were scared.

00:04:16.836 --> 00:04:20.298
And so I ended up having to hire
an armed security guard to protect them.

00:04:21.424 --> 00:04:23.342
And I felt alone,

00:04:23.342 --> 00:04:26.304
like, on every dimension
you can think of --

00:04:26.304 --> 00:04:29.432
geography, industry,

00:04:29.473 --> 00:04:32.560
gender and, yeah, race.